and Jerry）是由威廉·汉纳（William Hanna）和约瑟夫·巴伯拉（Joseph Barbera）自1940年起制作的动画系列。作品共分为163集短剧（1940-2005），5部TV版（1975-2014），10部电影版（1992-2013）。\r\n汉纳-巴伯拉/米高梅动画时期制作114集（1940-1957），期间获得了7次奥斯卡最佳动画短片奖；\r\nGene Deitch/Rembrandt Films cartoons时期制作13集（1961-1962）；\r\n查克·琼斯/Sib Tower 12 cartoons时期制作34集（1963-1967）；\r\n汉纳-巴伯拉/透纳娱乐时期制作1集The Mansion Cat（2001）；\r\n华纳动画时期制作1集The Karate Guard（2005）；\r\n以上为163集短剧作品。\r\n1992制作了首部电影版作品Tom and Jerry: The Movie。\r\n2014年推出新TV版动画。", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "2296": {"data": {"tag_id": 2296, "tag_name": "魔兽世界", "cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/tag/8b42e80c9480ee705a71d623536019dbbc378c7b.jpg", "head_cover": "", "content": "　魔兽争霸系列游戏经过长达十年的发展，魔兽世界已经成为一个拥有巨大而完善的故事背景和庞大的历史架构的魔幻世界，各种设定更为广大玩家接受和推崇。网络游戏魔兽世界也因此拥有完整的世界设定，堪称史诗的游戏背景，主线故事与游戏的发展环环相扣，引人入胜。———百科\r\n  \r\n\r\n苦不苦想想当年荆棘谷，累不累想想黑上跑尸队。", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "32767": {"data": {"tag_id": 32767, "tag_name": "古典音乐", "cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/tag/004abd880fabfba2dc705c5a4748c8ad110f0e15.jpg", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "1296": {"data": {"tag_id": 1296, "tag_name": "经典", "cover": "", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "19913": {"data": {"tag_id": 19913, "tag_name": "